<section class="contact" id="contact">
  <div class="container contact-wrap">
    <div class="contact-info">
      <h2 class="section-title">咨询购买与合作</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">告诉我们你的头皮状态，我们给你匹配建议与使用方案。</p>
      <ul class="contact-list">
        <li><i class="fas fa-phone"></i> 电话：<span class="contact-val">400-000-0000</span></li>
        <li><i class="fas fa-comment-dots"></i> 微信：<span class="contact-val">miaobenfang</span></li>
        <li><i class="fas fa-envelope"></i> 邮箱：<span class="contact-val">service@miaobenfang.com</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-card">
      <h3>快速咨询</h3>
      <p>留下联系方式，我们将在24小时内为您匹配专属头皮护理方案。</p>
      <form class="contact-form" action="#" method="POST">
        <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="您的姓名" required>
        <input type="text" name="phone" placeholder="手机号/微信号" required>
        <select name="concern">
          <option value="">请选择您的头皮困扰</option>
          <option value="oily">头皮易出油</option>
          <option value="dandruff">头屑反复</option>
          <option value="itchy">头皮发痒</option>
          <option value="hairloss">掉发焦虑</option>
          <option value="other">其他</option>
        </select>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">提交咨询</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.contact-wrap {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 48px;
}
.contact-info { flex: 1; }
.contact-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin-top: 24px; }
.contact-list li { padding: 12px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #555; }
.contact-list li i { color: #4a7c3f; width: 28px; margin-right: 12px; }
.contact-val { font-weight: 600; color: #2d4a2a; }
.contact-card {
  flex: 1;
  background: white;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 36px 32px;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}
.contact-card h3 { font-size: 22px; color: #2d4a2a; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.contact-card p { font-size: 14px; color: #888; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.contact-form input,
.contact-form select {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 12px 16px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  border: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-size: 14px;
  outline: none;
  transition: border-color 0.3s;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
.contact-form input:focus,
.contact-form select:focus { border-color: #4a7c3f; }
.btn-block { width: 100%; text-align: center; }
@media (max-width: 768px) { .contact-wrap { flex-direction: column; } }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Contact",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Contact" }]
}
{% endschema %}